<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's Kegalle Q1 net up 38.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's Kegalle Q1 net up 38.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>    Net profit	 27.82     vs	20.09</p>
<p>    Turnover	  180.32     vs     141.11</p>
<p>    Tax		   0.30     vs	 --</p>
<p>Note: Results are unaudited. Kegalle Plantations Ltd manages tea and rubber estates and is a unit of blue chip, John Keells Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
